DATA LICENCE

The licence for the PickGlass data will be stated in this file when the
data are released after review (see DATASHEET.md).

Covered by this file (the "data files"), wherever they sit in this
repository:
  - the files under data/ (manifest, scene map, window polygons, photo
    provenance, legacy hand counts, predictions);
  - every copy or part of those files elsewhere in this repository, for
    example annotation_tool/data/manifest.json,
    annotation_tool/data/scenes_check.csv and cnn/data/scene_map.csv;
  - every per-image machine prediction on the PickGlass photos, the legacy
    crops, or copies and renders of them: the source files listed in
    data/predictions/INDEX.csv and the other per-image prediction files
    under methods/, cnn/, vlm/, gpu_results/, ft_results/, genai_sr/,
    camera_aug/ and paper/tables/;
  - released after review, on an archive with a DOI: the photos, rectified
    crops, renders and both annotators' counts with dot positions.

Everything else in this repository (source code and documentation) is
covered by the MIT licence in LICENSE.

Until a licence is stated here, no rights to the data are granted beyond
viewing them in this repository for the purpose of reviewing and reproducing
the paper.
